By setting up NGINX 1.22 for load balancing and caching, you can significantly improve the performance and scalability of your API. This setup will help distribute traffic evenly across multiple nodes, reduce latency, and improve overall response times. If you have any specific requirements or need further assistance, feel free to ask!

Setting up health checks to monitor system health continuously is crucial for ensuring that your system remains reliable and responsive. Here are some best practices and tools you can use to implement effective health checks:

### 1. **Define Health Check Endpoints**
