By using these tools and frameworks, you can simplify the implementation of audit trails and logging for GDPR compliance. Each tool has its strengths, so choose the ones that best fit your application's architecture and requirements. Regularly review and update your logging mechanisms to ensure they continue to meet GDPR standards.

